WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.367
"Today, you are going to the doctor."

2
00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:12.402
"But I'm not sick, Mom."

3
00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:14.068
"You need a checkup."

4
00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:17.161
"Mom, what is a checkup?"

5
00:00:17.162 --> 00:00:19.184
"The doctor looks at you.

6
00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.946
He checks that you are healthy."

7
00:00:21.947 --> 00:00:23.848
"Will it be hard?"

8
00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:26.318
"No, it will be easy."

9
00:00:26.319 --> 00:00:31.641
"Oh, I don't know."

10
00:00:31.642 --> 00:00:33.533
"Stick out your tongue, Richard."

11
00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:38.514
"I can stick out my tongue."

12
00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:40.066
"Pull up your shirt."

13
00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:42.796
"No problem. That is simple.

14
00:00:42.797 --> 00:00:45.817
I can pull up my shirt."

15
00:00:45.818 --> 00:00:48.719
"Now, Richard, can you touch your toes?"

16
00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:50.662
"This is too simple.

17
00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:54.839
I can touch my toes."

18
00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.318
"Turn your head, Richard.

19
00:00:56.319 --> 00:00:58.213
I will look into your ear."

20
00:00:58.214 --> 00:01:00.102
"I can turn my head.

21
00:01:00.103 --> 00:01:04.192
A checkup is very easy."

22
00:01:04.193 --> 00:01:06.643
"Richard, let's see how much you weigh.

23
00:01:06.644 --> 00:01:08.491
Stand on the scales."

24
00:01:08.492 --> 00:01:10.837
"I can stand on the scales.

25
00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:13.806
That's easy for me."

26
00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:15.323
"How tall are you, Richard?

27
00:01:15.324 --> 00:01:17.033
Stand up tall."

28
00:01:17.034 --> 00:01:19.112
"I can stand up tall.

29
00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:21.369
Look at me."

30
00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.016
"Now I will check your eyes.

31
00:01:23.017 --> 00:01:25.077
Please, look into this light."

32
00:01:25.078 --> 00:01:27.607
"Okay. This is really easy.

33
00:01:27.608 --> 00:01:30.531
I can look at the light."

34
00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:33.021
"Richard, can you pull down your pants?"

35
00:01:33.022 --> 00:01:36.482
"Ha-ha! I am very good at that.

36
00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:40.190
That's easy too."

37
00:01:40.191 --> 00:01:42.559
"Ouch! Ouch!"

38
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.751
"Finished! That was easy for you, Richard."

39
00:01:45.752 --> 00:01:52.197
"I don't know. Ouch."
